^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Resolution 2026-07-30: the reproducer is a clang-builtin shape
(__remove_reference_t in a default argument); under --cpp20 alone the
GCC-mode scanner lexes the builtin as a plain identifier, which is a
different (mode-availability) failure -- and the abort it led to is
now a recoverable diagnostic (get_component result checked in the
constructor-temporary path).  Run in CLANG mode (--stdlib libc++),
where the original bug lived, the program verifies.
